 > waywall is still under development. Some features are missing or may
 > not work as expected.
 
+Minecraft 26.3 uses SDL's Wayland backend by default. waywall accepts its
+startup request to clear the XDG toplevel parent and applies configured mouse
+sensitivity to raw relative motion.
+
 # Installation
 
 waywall is available through some package managers, and prebuilt binary packages
